            "contentId": "Loop3_1_ZhouShu_node_13_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Anyway, don’t let go no matter what! We should be within city range now—hopefully this works.",
                "zh": "不管怎样，待会千万别松手！现在应该在市区范围了，但愿这能行。",
